      "value": "Ohhhh test avatars. I've experienced this a few times. \n\nI think the reference to the local user is broken. When I have this bug, my avatar loads for other users in the instance, and the other neat observation is that it the world has leave notifications, when I leave instead of my name being who leaves, Player left instead.\n\nSometimes simply rejoining the instance gets the avatar back to normal\n\nTo put it simply,\n\nBug: load in to new world with no avatar\n\nExpectation: load in whatever avatar live service thinks I should be wearing",
