  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you test and build an avatar for VRchat. \n\nAnd then switch into that avatar in VRchat for testing, \n\nThen switch to a different world (any world) the test avatar will not load and also any other avatar will not load (even non test avatars)\n\nThe loading bar above your head will just stay at zero percent\n\nMy current workaround if this problem happens is to switch out of the test avatar then rejoin the world then switch back into the test avatar. \n\nReasons for doing this with a test avatar is to see how the shaders of your avatar interacts with the shaders and lighting of the specific world",
